Peter,

I wanted to send you a quick reminder of the stakes in this race.

I&rsquo;m running in one of the most competitive swing districts in America. It&rsquo;s a TOP pick up opportunity for Republicans and it&rsquo;s coming down to the wire.

My goal is to win this race, flip IL-17 RED, and defeat radical freshman Democrat, Eric Sorensen.

I know this race will be tough. These final two and a half weeks will be the most expensive stretch of our entire campaign. But I know that too much is on the line to hold back.

And I know, we CAN win and get to work for the great people of IL-17, with your help.

