To show you how close it is &mdash; this is the only district in Illinois that both the National Republican Congressional Committee (NRCC) and the Democratic Congressional Campaign Committee (DCCC) have on their top target lists!

Even though this is a swing district, we are being represented by someone who votes like a California Socialist: ● Sorensen votes with Democrats Nancy Pelosi and Adam Schiff 94% of the time!

● Sorensen votes against border security and sides with people that break our laws.

● Sorensen supports the failed liberal economic agenda that is driving inflation through the roof.

He ran as a moderate, but his voting record shows he&rsquo;s just another rubber stamp for radical Democrats in Washington.

We know the impacts Sorensen&rsquo;s radical agenda has had and we can&rsquo;t afford to let him win this race and continue his disastrous agenda.

